{
  "schemaVersion": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "entries": [
    {
      "id": "CustomShader",
      "field": "description",
      "sourceHash": "sha256:b4e698c79ca950182d5e8aa51a92a7fb48a04bb352ed7f12fbcb55e08b404aa2",
      "text": "用于 {@link Model} 和 {@link Cesium3DTileset} 的用户自定义 GLSL 着色器。\n<p>\n使用纹理 uniform 时，需要额外管理资源：\n</p>\n<ul>\n  <li>\n     必须每帧调用 <code>update</code>。将自定义着色器传给 {@link Model} 或 {@link Cesium3DTileset} 时，会自动完成此步骤。\n  </li>\n  <li>\n     不再需要自定义着色器时，必须调用 {@link CustomShader#destroy}，正确释放 GPU 资源。应用程序负责调用此方法。\n  </li>\n</ul>\n<p>\n详细文档参见{@link https://github.com/CesiumGS/cesium/tree/main/Documentation/CustomShaderGuide|自定义着色器指南}。\n</p>"
    },
    {
      "id": "CustomShader",
      "field": "params/options.fragmentShaderText/description",
      "sourceHash": "sha256:6b0b28073356e0ae91acd6d5fe5bc508082d0ca91d8a294c386359d5f29eb90e",
      "text": "自定义片元着色器的 GLSL 代码字符串，必须包含名为 fragmentMain 的 GLSL 函数，函数签名参见示例。未指定时，生成的片元着色器会跳过自定义片元处理步骤。"
    },
    {
      "id": "CustomShader",
      "field": "params/options.lightingModel/description",
      "sourceHash": "sha256:5d8ee7f2a876ada36e8ccbe73ff0862d67834869bfe16217abdcded7b0af7d26",
      "text": "光照模型，例如 PBR 或无光照。提供后会覆盖模型默认光照。"
    },
    {
      "id": "CustomShader",
      "field": "params/options.mode/description",
      "sourceHash": "sha256:8e49acddffc9ea0f50309deb3eadc4e6f2c4f3bb05dd6420f595b3106930f485",
      "text": "自定义着色器模式，决定代码插入片元着色器的方式。"
    },
    {
      "id": "CustomShader",
      "field": "params/options.translucencyMode/description",
      "sourceHash": "sha256:cf1cdfcab5734140b7fb951e427201d84ddb3b009fe6b1c37c7f9fdbd6f5f7f9",
      "text": "半透明模式，决定如何应用自定义着色器。为 CustomShaderTranslucencyMode.OPAQUE 或 CustomShaderTranslucencyMode.TRANSLUCENT 时，覆盖模型材质设置；为 CustomShaderTranslucencyMode.INHERIT 时，根据图元材质设置选择不透明或半透明渲染。"
    },
    {
      "id": "CustomShader",
      "field": "params/options.uniforms/description",
      "sourceHash": "sha256:64fe7b7a3b491855aa55c30aeba3bc537d021d550342577fede155e4956fd02a",
      "text": "用户自定义 uniform 的字典。键为 GLSL 代码中的 uniform 名称，值为描述其类型和初始值的对象。"
    },
    {
      "id": "CustomShader",
      "field": "params/options.varyings/description",
      "sourceHash": "sha256:3adbb0759f96e9724eb7385a9fc97a9ba4bf2215953a46df337beff30a6cb137",
      "text": "声明着色器额外 GLSL varying 的字典。键为 GLSL 代码中的 varying 名称，值为数据类型。每个 varying 的声明会自动添加到着色器开头。调用者负责在顶点着色器中赋值，并在片元着色器中使用。"
    },
    {
      "id": "CustomShader",
      "field": "params/options.vertexShaderText/description",
      "sourceHash": "sha256:9033c813cffec16ec802f22b33108d0ead77f82c9b9b482d45a33732119e2fd3",
      "text": "自定义顶点着色器的 GLSL 代码字符串，必须包含名为 vertexMain 的 GLSL 函数，函数签名参见示例。未指定时，生成的顶点着色器会跳过自定义顶点处理步骤。"
    },
    {
      "id": "CustomShader",
      "field": "params/options/description",
      "sourceHash": "sha256:cde8d9cb57ec027d68e75cfe77d95125e8c00971a09f74703456ed7875004725",
      "text": "包含以下选项的对象。"
    },
    {
      "id": "CustomShader#destroy",
      "field": "description",
      "sourceHash": "sha256:b385add820d9f47d540aad147f1cdf85f05e8c6cb81c3928a59c8fd5f7bd8d69",
      "text": "销毁此对象持有的 WebGL 资源。显式销毁可确定地释放 WebGL 资源，而不依赖垃圾回收器回收此对象。<br /><br />对象销毁后不应再使用；调用除 <code>isDestroyed</code> 以外的任何函数都会抛出 {@link DeveloperError}。因此，应像示例中那样将返回值（<code>undefined</code>）赋给该对象变量。"
    },
    {
      "id": "CustomShader#fragmentShaderText",
      "field": "description",
      "sourceHash": "sha256:b6b317cab3e705602c8463a2171e786b5c7304487b0a8b8081ebe66ecd3e0129",
      "text": "用户自定义的片元着色器 GLSL 代码。"
    },
    {
      "id": "CustomShader#isDestroyed",
      "field": "description",
      "sourceHash": "sha256:aea7b697937631c90ae3fc0ec55b81ba0ddc7abe4d6045848b2031f9bed60091",
      "text": "若此对象已销毁，返回 true；否则返回 false。<br /><br />对象销毁后不应再使用；调用除 <code>isDestroyed</code> 以外的任何函数都会抛出 {@link DeveloperError}。"
    },
    {
      "id": "CustomShader#lightingModel",
      "field": "description",
      "sourceHash": "sha256:bde41b6224edddb82960d715380743aa28ea349200bcc27a3b112300be78410d",
      "text": "自定义着色器使用的光照模型，由 {@link CustomShaderPipelineStage} 使用。"
    },
    {
      "id": "CustomShader#mode",
      "field": "description",
      "sourceHash": "sha256:b7d38d21b75fa7ce01956f557b203addea7014ee2f94e7d27651cd07e3f84789",
      "text": "决定自定义着色器如何与完整片元着色器交互的值，由 {@link CustomShaderPipelineStage} 使用。"
    },
    {
      "id": "CustomShader#setUniform",
      "field": "description",
      "sourceHash": "sha256:22e8c37f837632857b244d8f384eb98fe70c07b6fee4a7c550e3b22ece74a490",
      "text": "更新着色器中已声明 uniform 的值。"
    },
    {
      "id": "CustomShader#setUniform",
      "field": "params/uniformName/description",
      "sourceHash": "sha256:bc7a0c4ac5607c17976a77378bb26e162ad1f143c4d35418fd5a1674e1bb73b9",
      "text": "uniform 的 GLSL 名称，必须与构造时声明的某个 uniform 一致。"
    },
    {
      "id": "CustomShader#setUniform",
      "field": "params/value/description",
      "sourceHash": "sha256:c99495f1e676c46f52a2a288a460002ab54e47cac061f4516efa7b7632a68056",
      "text": "uniform 的新值。"
    },
    {
      "id": "CustomShader#translucencyMode",
      "field": "description",
      "sourceHash": "sha256:2f1f80c983e2c72ee1cc530db5f5719f21beab9408df2fa332ab49046fc36226",
      "text": "半透明模式，决定如何应用自定义着色器。为 CustomShaderTranslucencyMode.OPAQUE 或 CustomShaderTranslucencyMode.TRANSLUCENT 时，覆盖模型材质设置；为 CustomShaderTranslucencyMode.INHERIT 时，根据图元材质设置选择不透明或半透明渲染。"
    },
    {
