      "text": "描述 {@link CustomShader} 如何加入片元着色器的枚举，决定它与材质的交互方式。"
    },
    {
      "id": "CustomShaderMode",
      "field": "properties/MODIFY_MATERIAL/description",
      "sourceHash": "sha256:3b3c066ebfcb05b87911ec7add65662bb47ce22fa87ec8aace85095e591794bf",
      "text": "在应用光照之前，使用自定义着色器修改材质阶段的结果。"
    },
    {
      "id": "CustomShaderMode",
      "field": "properties/REPLACE_MATERIAL/description",
      "sourceHash": "sha256:a789d0afe069b9dc839b157c74da5aef7ee01461a0303ca129334954851d7fa7",
      "text": "使用自定义着色器替代材质阶段，可据此优化掉原有材质处理代码。"
    },
    {
      "id": "CustomShaderTranslucencyMode.INHERIT",
      "field": "description",
      "sourceHash": "sha256:9979326bf2c5018b9d983b5c9b0247f80dc19f86b2c232adaf27dc053fb7850e",
      "text": "继承图元材质的半透明设置。图元使用半透明材质时，自定义着色器也被视为半透明；图元使用不透明材质时，自定义着色器也被视为不透明。"
    },
    {
      "id": "CustomShaderTranslucencyMode.OPAQUE",
      "field": "description",
      "sourceHash": "sha256:97b0a033f2da8801dd5ee450e9caf519c69120cf63ddfddb8a63e5f7c12b9174",
      "text": "强制以不透明方式渲染图元，忽略材质设置。"
    },
    {
      "id": "CustomShaderTranslucencyMode.TRANSLUCENT",
      "field": "description",
      "sourceHash": "sha256:7336458d380c16cd7cd4f6f8a20aa0555ce93ded557f2b68ee2683d8bb8a7a97",
